  "description": "Ji Kang Hyeok, a well-known actor known as an actor who has a lot of scandal. Yoo Je-Ah, a beautiful actress who is famous for her good image and has never been involved in a scandal. However, there was big news when they decided to get married. Marriage that is not based on love. How does their story continue...?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%B7%B8%EB%86%88%EC%9D%98-%EC%8A%A4%EC%BA%94%EB%93%A4/1409), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/51761535)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[T.Chinese](https://tw.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E4%BB%96%E5%80%91%E7%9A%84%E7%B7%8B%E8%81%9E/9), [Thai](https://page.kakao.com/content/67010078)",
